{"id":2081,"chapter_id":2,"scene_id":208,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"门后是一条逼仄的走廊，向下延伸，通往深邃不可知的黑暗。墙壁地面不断传来液体滴落的声音。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"海拉","content":"唔……我讨厌这里，想吐。","voice":["vo_cgplot_2081002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":106,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"不要碰墙壁，精神会被污染的。","voice":["vo_cgplot_2081003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":106,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"海拉","content":"那，赫卡蒂，你扶我一下。唔，混蛋，你别躲呀！呕呕呕——","voice":["vo_cgplot_2081004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":106,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"污染来自那个禁闭者，她已经彻底暴走，完全是狂厄的中心。封锁这里是对的，这种环境，普通人下来只会立刻疯狂。","voice":["vo_cgplot_2081005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":106,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"选项","content":"那泰德呢？","options":["那泰德呢？"],"jump":[7],"style":6,"background":106,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"他不是禁闭者，也没有枷锁。下场只会一样。","voice":["vo_cgplot_2081007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":106,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"可你不认为，那个人会做这种坑了自己的蠢事。他一定还有你不知道的什么后手。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"content":"赫卡蒂停住脚步。阶梯的前方，出现了几个人影。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"病患","content":"呜…………呜呜…………救……","voice":["vo_cgplot_2081010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":106,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"他们靠近了你，借着警报灯微弱的光芒，你认出来，他们中的几人，正是那场手术里艾恩救下的为数不多的狂厄者。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1}]}